sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant JOB as Background job scheduler
    participant W as AI worker
    participant L as Bounded loop
    participant D as Isolated dispatch
    participant T as Tool layer
    participant M as LLM provider

    JOB->>W: start bounded AI job
    W->>L: run synthesis loop under round, time, and token limits
    loop Gather phase
        L->>M: call with advertised tools
        M-->>L: tool calls
        L->>L: verify call is allowed for this context
        L->>D: dispatch approved call
        D->>T: execute with authorization scope and timeout
        T-->>D: tool result
        D-->>L: isolated result (crash or timeout contained)
    end
    alt Terminal phase
        L->>M: request final plan
        M-->>L: plan result
        L-->>W: terminal result
    else Limit reached
        L->>L: enter finish mode
        L-->>W: forced terminal or non-retryable timeout
    end
    W-->>JOB: complete or bounded stop
